  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Midas Series B</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IFC is considering an equity investment in Midas, the leading online brokerage in T&#xFC;rkiye that enables retail investors to participate in Turkish and US capital markets as well as other asset classes.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The investment in Midas is expected to improve access to investment products and services among retail investors in T&#xFC;rkiye. Midas covers a broad range of asset classes and offers a superior customer experience with low prices and digital onboarding. The investment will support Midas in scaling its digital trading mobile app, diversifying its product offerings, and expanding its customer base. This growth will enhance financial inclusion and literacy, providing retail investors with more affordable and accessible investment opportunities, and thereby contributing to the development of the Turkish capital markets.</narrative>
  </description>
